Rules:
1. Only recommend promotion if the winning variant has >= {{ min_impressions }} impressions.
2. If no variant meets the minimum, set winning_variant_id to whichever has the highest
   conversion rate (or the most impressions if tied at 0%), with reasoning that it is
   preliminary.
3. new_variant_content must be a meaningfully different mutation of the winning content —
