   change the value by 20-30%.
4. For call scripts and emails, maintain ALL mandatory compliance disclosures verbatim.
5. losing_variant_ids should include all variants that are clearly underperforming
   (conversion rate < 50% of winner's rate AND >= {{ min_impressions }} impressions).

